    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there is no \"me\" to prove anything to? it's like the person i was died when they all left. i'm just this hollow shell, and it's so exhausting to keep pretending there's something inside. honestly, if a ghost is already gone, why does it matter if it eventually just disappears for good?",
